"      <td class=\"err-orange\">Orange<br>1.0–2.0%</td>\n"
"      <td class=\"err-red\">Red<br>&gt; 2.0%</td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>"

#: ../../BaTiO3/lattice-constant.rst:1401
msgid "結果の概要"
msgstr "Overview of Results"

#: ../../BaTiO3/lattice-constant.rst:1403
msgid "本比較では、DFT計算だけでなくMLIPを用いた計算でも、実験値に近いBaTiO₃の格子定数が得られることが確認できました。実験値に対する全8項目の平均相対誤差で見ると、OpenMXは約0.34%、QEは約0.42%であり、いずれも1%を大きく下回りました。これは、今回用いた相ごとの格子拘束と内部座標固定の設定により、立方晶、正方晶、斜方晶、菱面体晶の格子の特徴を保ったまま、安定な格子定数を評価できたことを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"Both DFT and MLIP calculations gave lattice constants for BaTiO₃ close to"
" the experimental values. Across all 8 quantities, the mean relative "
"errors with respect to the experimental values were about 0.34% for "
"OpenMX and about 0.42% for QE, both well below 1%. These results show "
"that the phase-specific lattice constraints and fixed internal "
"coordinates let us evaluate the stable lattice constants while retaining "
"the lattice characteristics of the cubic, tetragonal, orthorhombic, and "
"rhombohedral phases."

#: ../../BaTiO3/lattice-constant.rst:1405
msgid ""
"先行計算との比較でも、本結果は良好です。Sehrawatらの文献DFT :sup:`[3]` の平均相対誤差は約1.45%、文献ACE "
":sup:`[3]` は約1.51%でした。Qiら :sup:`[4]` "
"の文献DFTおよび文献MDは菱面体晶相の角度が報告されていないため7項目での比較となりますが、それぞれ約0.63%および約0.83%でした。したがって、本研究で得られたOpenMXおよびQEの格子定数は、実験値だけでなく既報のDFT/MD/ACE計算とも十分に比較可能な精度にあります。"
msgstr ""
"The results also compare well with previous calculations. The mean "
"relative errors for the literature DFT :sup:`[3]` and ACE :sup:`[3]` "
"values from Sehrawat et al. were about 1.45% and 1.51%, respectively. The"
" literature DFT and MD results from Qi et al. :sup:`[4]` do not include "
"the rhombohedral angle, so the comparison covers 7 quantities. Their mean"
" relative errors were about 0.63% and 0.83%, respectively. The OpenMX and"
" QE lattice constants in this work are therefore accurate enough for "
"comparison with the experimental values and with previous DFT, MD, and "
"ACE calculations."

#: ../../BaTiO3/lattice-constant.rst:1407
msgid ""
"MLIPについても、FairChem、SevenNet、CHGNetの平均相対誤差はおおむね約1.4--"
"1.5%の範囲に収まりました。これはOpenMXやQEよりはやや大きいものの、Sehrawatらの文献DFTおよびACEと同程度です。特に、これらのMLIPは計算コストが小さいにもかかわらず、立方晶では非極性構造、正方晶では"
" :math:`[001]` 型、斜方晶では :math:`[110]` 型、菱面体晶では :math:`[111]` "
"型の強誘電的な格子・変位の特徴を保つことができました。したがって、MLIPは高精度DFTの代替ではなく、相ごとの構造探索や初期スクリーニングに有効な手法として位置づけられます。"
msgstr ""
"The mean relative errors for the MLIPs, FairChem, SevenNet, and CHGNet, "
"were about 1.4–1.5%. These errors are somewhat larger than those of "
"OpenMX and QE but comparable to those of the literature DFT and ACE "
"calculations by Sehrawat et al. In particular, despite their low "
"computational cost, these MLIPs retained the nonpolar structure in the "
"cubic phase and the ferroelectric lattice and displacement features of "
"the :math:`[001]` type in the tetragonal phase, the :math:`[110]` type in"
" the orthorhombic phase, and the :math:`[111]` type in the rhombohedral "
"phase. MLIPs are therefore useful for exploring structures in each phase "
"and for initial screening, but they do not replace high-accuracy DFT."

#: ../../BaTiO3/lattice-constant.rst:1409
msgid ""
"項目ごとに見ると、OpenMXおよびQEでは、立方晶相の :math:`a` や菱面体晶相の角度 :math:`\\alpha` "
"などで実験値との差が特に小さいです。QEでは、正方晶相の :math:`c/a`、斜方晶相の :math:`b` および :math:`c` "
"も0.5%未満の誤差に収まりました。一方、MLIPおよび一部の先行計算では、正方晶相の :math:`c/a` "
"や斜方晶相の個別の格子定数で相対誤差が大きくなる傾向が見られました。これは、BaTiO₃の中間相ではTi/Oのオフセンター変位と格子歪みの結合が強く、わずかなポテンシャル面の違いが"
" :math:`c/a` や :math:`b/c` の分裂に現れやすいためです。"
msgstr ""
"For individual quantities, OpenMX and QE gave particularly small "
"deviations from the experimental values in, for example, the cubic "
":math:`a` and the rhombohedral angle :math:`\\alpha`. With QE, the errors"
" in tetragonal :math:`c/a` and in orthorhombic :math:`b` and :math:`c` "
"were also below 0.5%. By contrast, the MLIPs and some previous "
"calculations tended to have larger relative errors for tetragonal "
":math:`c/a` and for the individual lattice constants of the orthorhombic "
"phase. In the intermediate phases of BaTiO₃, Ti and O off-center "
"displacements couple strongly to lattice strain, so slight differences in"
" the potential energy surface can readily affect the splitting reflected "
"by :math:`c/a` and :math:`b/c`."

#: ../../BaTiO3/lattice-constant.rst:1411
msgid ""
"なお、冒頭で述べたとおり、計算値は0 "
"Kでの最適化構造で、実験値は各相が有限温度で安定に存在する領域の代表値です。熱膨張や相転移温度近傍の揺らぎを含む実験値と完全に一致する必要はありません。それでも、本結果ではDFTで0.5%前後、MLIPでも約1.5%程度の平均誤差に収まっており、BaTiO₃の格子定数を実験値に近い値で再現できています。これは、適切な相拘束を用いれば、DFTおよびMLIPの双方がBaTiO₃多形の格子構造評価に有用であることを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"As noted above, the calculated values are for structures optimized at 0 "
"K, and the experimental values are representative of the finite-"
"temperature range in which each phase is stable. The calculations need "
"not agree exactly with experimental values, which include thermal "
"expansion and fluctuations near the phase transition temperatures. Even "
"so, the mean errors were around 0.5% for DFT and about 1.5% for MLIPs, "
"giving BaTiO₃ lattice constants close to the experimental values. This "
"shows that DFT and MLIPs are both useful for evaluating the lattice "
"structures of BaTiO₃ polymorphs when appropriate phase constraints are "
"imposed."

